    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-oster-mechanochemical-chondrogenesis-measurement-2x2-factorial-synergy-test-at-tau-0-85-condensation-counts-mechanics-only-bsw-only-sox9-feedback-only-hybrid-rmse-vs-0-0-0-4> a schema:PropertyValue,
