    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-oster-mechanochemical-chondrogenesis-measurement-2x2-factorial-synergy-test-at-tau-0-85-condensation-counts-mechanics-only-bsw-only-sox9-feedback-only-hybrid-rmse-vs-0-0-0-4-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        dcterms:source "Synergy prediction of the hybrid dispersion relation (neither subsystem alone is unstable at tau=0.85, g=0.7); Oster, Murray & Maini (1985) Sec. 5 discussion of chemical pre-pattern + mechanics" ;
